{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the fiddle, take a detour, go on an adventure\u2014sometimes.<br>So... what was the goal again?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinono is a curious traveler who casts magic through the sound of her fiddle.<br>Alongside her companions, she sets off on a journey to collect five magical artifacts.<br>But in this world, there's no right order\u2014no set ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions gently shape both the path and the conclusion of her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxed RPG featuring peaceful exploration,<br>turn-based combat, charming low-poly visuals,<br>and a story that cherishes small emotional moments.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy world where music and magic intertwine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters and partings with unique companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melodies are procedurally generated from the materials you collect<br>\u2500\u2500no two journeys sound the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and the freedom to stray from the main path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm, picture book-inspired visual style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of Pinono\u2019s journey,<br>you may just discover what magic truly means.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2794390?t=1758160283","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2794390?t=1758160283","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794390/0c2c306df2d2fa434f9ce2304c897aba81b62efe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758160283","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794390/0c2c306df2d2fa434f9ce2304c897aba81b62efe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758160283","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the fiddle, take a detour, go on an adventure\u2014sometimes.<br>So... what was the goal again?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinono is a curious traveler who casts magic through the sound of her fiddle.<br>Alongside her companions, she sets off on a journey to collect five magical artifacts.<br>But in this world, there's no right order\u2014no set ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions gently shape both the path and the conclusion of her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxed RPG featuring peaceful exploration,<br>turn-based combat, charming low-poly visuals,<br>and a story that cherishes small emotional moments.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy world where music and magic intertwine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters and partings with unique companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melodies are procedurally generated from the materials you collect<br>\u2500\u2500no two journeys sound the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and the freedom to stray from the main path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm, picture book-inspired visual style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of Pinono\u2019s journey,<br>you may just discover what magic truly means.</p>","developers":["helomiux"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794390/e3192d24c63fee69bd86470cc824a2b47fa2fa38/header.jpg?t=1758160283","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mini